<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Writing — Chirag Gandhi</title>
		<style>
			:root { --ink: #1a1a1a; --muted: #666; --accent: #e8590c; --bg: #fffdf8; }
			* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
			body { font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; }
			.container { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
			nav { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			nav a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
			h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.sub { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
			.card { border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: #fff; }
			.card h3 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
			.card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
			.status { font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: var(--accent); }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="container">
			<nav>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/">Home</a>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/about">About</a>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/projects">Projects</a>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/writing">Writing</a>
			</nav>
			<h1>Writing</h1>
			<div class="sub">Notes on building in public, AI pipelines, and what I learn shipping real things.</div>

			<div class="card">
				<div class="status">Coming soon</div>
				<h3>First post: why I'm publishing my work in public</h3>
				<p>The story behind this site, and the rule that runs it: a project counts when a stranger can open it.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
